        description: 'Score each non-winner: sum card values in hand (Joker 25, Black Ace 15, K-Q-J-10 ten, 2-9 face value, Red Ace 1). Winner scores 0. If winner went down and out in one turn, opponents double their penalty. Lowest total after 9 hands wins.',
